# The number keys of a mission: Ctrl with a number makes a team of what is
# selected, the number alone selects that team and nothing else, Shift with
# it adds the team to the selection, and the number of a team nobody is in
# lets everything go. Then two of the developers' keys: F4, which lifts the
# shroud and puts it back, and F3, which numbers and colors the cells.
# args: -PLAYTEST
at 301 click 320 58
at 501 click 160 200
at 3001 click 499 240
at 3020 shot one_soldier_selected
at 3021 keydown CTRL
at 3022 key 1
at 3025 keyup CTRL
at 3031 click 513 240
at 3041 keydown CTRL
at 3042 key 0
at 3045 keyup CTRL
at 3050 shot other_soldier_selected
at 3051 rclick 300 300
at 3061 key 1
at 3080 shot team_1
at 3081 keydown SHIFT
at 3082 key 0
at 3085 keyup SHIFT
at 3100 shot team_1_and_team_10
at 3101 key 2
at 3120 shot team_2_is_empty
at 3121 key 0
at 3140 shot team_10
at 3141 key F4
at 3160 shot map_revealed
at 3161 key F3
at 3200 shot cell_info
at 3201 key F3
at 3220 shot cell_info_off
at 3221 key F4
at 3240 shot shroud_back
at 3241 quit
